WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.677
Preserving the pitch was the most interesting part to

2
00:00:02.677 --> 00:00:02.980
build.

3
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:05.161
On YouTube, if you slow a song down,

4
00:00:05.161 --> 00:00:07.220
the voice sounds like slow motion.

5
00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:11.100
Here you can choose to keep it sounding the same,

6
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.000
at the pace of the beat.

7
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.476
There are effects too, like Echo and Next Room,

8
00:00:17.476 --> 00:00:21.952
that you can combine to create strange feelings

9
00:00:21.952 --> 00:00:24.524
— like you're at a concert,

10
00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:27.571
or in the concert's parking lot,

11
00:00:27.571 --> 00:00:32.524
or hearing the music from your neighbor's party next

12
00:00:32.524 --> 00:00:33.000
door.

13
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.500
And if you put on headphones and close your eyes,

14
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.000
it really takes you to that moment.

15
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.387
Here's a quick example of how Dákiti sounds playing

16
00:00:43.387 --> 00:00:47.000
with the app's effects — just a quick one.

17
00:00:47.000 --> 00:01:19.041
♪
